{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19942","headline":"石淙 六 · 孟郊","name":"石淙 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百尺明镜流，千曲寒星飞。\n爲君洗故物，有色如新衣。\n不饮泥土污，但饮雪霜饥。\n石棱玉纤纤，草色琼霏霏。\n谷磑有余力，溪舂亦多机。\n从来一智萌，能使衆利归。\n因之山水中，喧然论是非。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19942.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19942","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}